      "content": "\n■ 면허·자격 증명 발급규정 [별지 제6호 서식] <개정 2026. 4. 9.>\n\n\nMinistry of Health and Welfare\nCertificate of Current Professional Status\n\nName in Full     :\nDate of Birth     :\nName of Profession      :\nLicense Number       :\nDate of License Issued:\n\nI hereby certify that the above license is currently in good\nstanding, although there is a record of past or planned\ndisciplinary action as follows:\n\nDisciplinary History:\n· Date of Administrative Action:\n· Type of Action:\n· Status: Completed\n(Note: No other disciplinary actions are in record as of the date\nof this Certificate.)\n\n\nBoard Seal  Signature :\n\nTitle : Minister of Health and Welfare\n\nAddress : 13, Doum 4-Ro, Sejong-si,\n\nRepublic of Korea 30113\n\nDate    :\n\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n\n◆ This Certificate was issued by the Ministry of Health and Welfare (MOHW). Any forgery or\nfalsification of the Certificate can be checked on the “Authenticity Check for Issued Documents”\nmenu of the MOHW website (lic.mohw.go.kr), which is available for 90 days from the date of\nissuance, or by the barcode at the bottom of the Certificate.\nRemark: The seal of the issuer on the Certificate is the official government stamp (which includes\nthe electronic image of the official stamp).\n\n210mm×297mm[백상지 80g/㎡]\n",
